title: "cardargus: Generate SVG Information Cards with Embedded Fonts and Badges (Python)"
abstract: >-
  Create self-contained SVG information cards with embedded Google Fonts,
  shields-style badges, sparklines and custom logos. Python port of the R
  package cardargus.
type: software
